{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15112","headline":"北至太原 · 李益","name":"北至太原","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎祚昔昏替，皇基此郁盘。\n玄命久已集，抚运良乃艰。\n南厄羊肠险，北走雁门寒。\n始於一戎定，垂此亿世安。\n唐风本忧思，王业寔艰难。\n中历虽横溃，天纪未可干。\n圣明所兴国，灵岳固不殚。\n咄咄薄游客，斯言殊不刊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}